        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/edb3f5/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-09T15:44:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Citizen Truth.&nbsp; You know it in your heart.&nbsp; Him coming out is almost as bad as Devastating Aurora, unless you've got a *ton* of firepower on hand and nothing else you desperately need to kill.&nbsp; And even if you've killed him once, him being dead makes Return With The Dawn tens times scarier, because every single turn there's a chance he'll be back.</p>",
