        "created_at": "2016-02-09T17:22:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Blood, Sweat, and Tears or really anything else that forces a discard are in my list of hated cards to be sure. Although because it hadn't been mentioned here yet I'll submit: The Informant and cards like her. These cards that that punish you for a standard action, and you have to do said action to deal with them. Specifically the out of turn villian plays can really let things get out of hand quickly.</p>",
