        "created_at": "2016-02-11T14:08:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You mean the Contract?</p>\n<p>I’m gonna have to go with the Sweat + Tears combo. Especially if Truth is also in play…</p>\n<p>That or the Cohorts. The Matriarch is tough enough with all the birds and the retaliation damage for all the birds, but then she also has the Carrion Fields. And THEN she ALSO has the Cohorts. And THEN one of them pulls the other out of the trash.</p>",
